{
  "name": "scatter_sanskrit",
  "description": "Sanskrit consonants on the standardized 11-column place axis (back→front: glottal, pharyngeal, uvular, velar, palatal, post-alveolar, alveolar, dental, interdental, labio-dental, bilabial). Sanskrit's 5 vargas concentrate in 5 of the 11 columns — a tight cluster signature. 7 manner rows (the AP3-faithful structure). 33 cells filled.",
